    "step8_outcome_verification": {
      "primary_intent": "The user wanted the agent to open the FRED UNRATE (Unemployment Rate) series page and accurately extract (verbatim) the series metadata (units, frequency, seasonal-adjustment status) plus the three latest displayed observation months and values. A reasonable user would be flexible on minor formatting/presentation (e.g., bulleting), but not flexible on missing any of the three latest observations or altering the exact wording/values the task asked to preserve.",
